  "mu_name_from": "Lorencia's object slot 25. WorldObjectCatalog.cs runs Grass as a block of eight from 20, so Grass06.bmd is type 25.",
  "world": "lorencia",
  "object_type": 25,
  "why_this_one": "Placement count. Grass05's sheet on a smaller clump. Lorencia stands 1031 clumps of grass between the seven kinds - 36% of everything in the town - and each one is a handful of crossed cards wearing a cut-out sheet, so the cheapest assets in the map are also the ones that fill most of it.",
